  "description": "■Unique Controls\nExplore the unique and challenging \"Rotation Control Mode\" where your character spins as you rotate the stick.\n\nThe game starts with a standard control method, making it easy for anyone to enjoy. When you're ready, dive into the challenge of mastering the unique \"Rotation Control Mode,\" where your character spins as you rotate the stick.\n\n■Unique World\nThere is no time to worry about why macho is in space or why he does side rolls.\n\nAll you need to understand is that he is in space and must return to Earth.\n\n■Simple Rules\nThe only way is up! All you need is the physical strength to keep rolling and the determination to never give up.\n\n■Various Areas\nAs you progress, the environment changes, demanding different strategies. To survive in space, you must adapt to the situation.\n\n■Great Music\nThe music changes with each area and will make you feel excited. Enjoy the carefully curated soundtrack.",
